@namespace ColonnadeGrid
@typeparam TItem
@typeparam TProp
@*
    Declares a column of a ColonnadeGrid<TItem>. Renders no markup of its
    own — it registers a column definition with the table's cascaded
    GridContext<TItem>, and the table renders headers/cells from that
    registered list. This file exists (rather than a plain C# class) so the
    Razor compiler can infer TItem (via the table's
    [CascadingTypeParameter]) and TProp (from the Field expression's return
    type) at each <GridColumn> call site without either being spelled out
    explicitly. See GridColumn.razor.cs for parameters and registration logic.
*@
